#!name=大蓝树自动签到 (二合一终极版)
#!desc=抓包与签到共用同一个自建脚本，彻底解决 Token 变量名不匹配与过期问题。
#!author=liukaiqiao
#!icon=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fmz200/wool_scripts/main/icons/apps/dalanshu.png
[Script]
1. 获取 Token (已修正为全小写的 dalanshu_checkin.js)
http-request ^https?://dalanshu.top/api/v1/me/checkin/status script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/liukaiqiao/Loon-Rules/refs/heads/main/Task/dalanshu_checkin.js, requires-body=false, timeout=20, tag=大蓝树获取Token, img-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fmz200/wool_scripts/main/icons/apps/dalanshu.png
2. 定时签到 (每天早上 7:05 执行)
cron "5 7 * * *" script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/liukaiqiao/Loon-Rules/refs/heads/main/Task/dalanshu_checkin.js, timeout=60, tag=大蓝树每日签到, img-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fmz200/wool_scripts/main/icons/apps/dalanshu.png
[Mitm]
hostname = dalanshu.top